Package: mbBench
Type: Package
Title: Conditional Microbiome Simulation and Benchmark Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("MicrobiomeBench", "Authors", email = "zhangzhizhuo@sjtu.edu.cn", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Loads pre-generated microbiome benchmark datasets directly in R
    and provides an optional interface to the mbBench Python backend for
    conditional simulation and truth-informed benchmark generation. Standard
    DA and batch-correction result tables can be evaluated directly in R.
